Recipe conditional operations
├── when ReadIf is selected
│   ├── it resolves the gate before either branch
│   ├── when the gate is zero
│   │   ├── it skips absent, malformed and reverting queries and invalid bindings
│   │   └── it resolves and validates only the fallback operand
│   ├── when the gate is nonzero
│   │   ├── it skips invalid fallback operands
│   │   └── it retains query binding and complete return word validation
│   ├── it preserves full-width inputs and results across both branches and subsequent bindings
│   ├── it rejects self, future and nonnumerical result references
│   └── it works in the account capability context
└── when ClearApproval is selected
    ├── it is rejected in the account capability context
    ├── when the allowance is zero
    │   ├── it skips token calls, leaf, proof and role checks
    │   ├── it consumes one runtime entry without decoding it
    │   └── it preserves following action runtime alignment
    ├── when the allowance is nonzero
    │   ├── it clears from the account after leaf, current proof and role validation
    │   ├── it accepts true, absent and trailing bool return data
    │   └── it rejects false or malformed responses and rolls back the approval
    ├── it never produces a referenceable number
    └── it leaves ordinary zero Approve unconditional
